      "title": "Letterboxd review of Edge of Tomorrow",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"Edge of Tomorrow\"] \"FIND ME WHEN YOU WAKE UP.\"God, this movie is so good. Still one of the finest alien designs I've ever seen on screen. And fuck, what a great screenplay! Feels like every couple of minutes the movie escalates in a way that makes something new exciting, and the point at which it escalates to a level where Blunt and Cruise are so good at fighting that they're going full anime is just absolutely unreal. The sequence that follows where we watch Cruise passively accept the casualties of soldiers around him as Paxton repeats \"hope in the form of glorious combat\" feels like a big middle finger to arm",
